 "status_note": "READY as a candidate only, by ship-gate/RULE-ship-gate.md §2: no verifier refuted its reader, and each of the six misreads the verifiers named was looked at again on the image and corrected (5) or upheld for the reader with what the image shows (1, C3). The Cowley verifier estimates that about 5% of the 563 new Cowley entries may still hold one wrong field (2 field errors in 40 drawn entries, both corrected, both in fields that are never keyed).",
