 "row_shape": "eight slots: [rank R(K)+n, route text, definition text, m_id, year, null, headwords, SAMARITAN]; fold to the served seven-slot ROUTE_STORE_V2 row by deleting [7] (index fold_to_served_v2)",
 "deploy_notes": [
  "All 258 files go together; a mix of files from two runs is not a store.",
  "The base store is not replaced and not edited. The overlay is read only when the reader's samaritan toggle is on.",
  "shard_path \"shards/{shard}.bin\" resolves against the directory of this overlay's own index.json.",
  "The rank R(K)+n puts every row after the base rows at its key on the rank slot only. The page sorts by tier, year, then rank, so the sort_rule (below every era-appropriate and tradition source) must be wired as a toggle-first comparison, composed above the licence sort.",
  "A row shows when the toggle is on and at least one lane in its slot [7].lanes is on. square_printed and tied are ruled; fmt_mt_word, bracketed_bare, argued_tie and turnover await the owner; printed_root has no row.",
  "Slot [7] is overlay-only. Both precedent overlays write seven slots; whether the reader accepts an eighth slot has not been tested."
 ],
